e spacing scale (\"160\" is the largest), so height=\"320\" is a type error: write height={20}. An icon or avatar box is usually \"24\" to \"48\".","spacing.tokens":"gap, padding and margin take spacing tokens (\"0\", \"1\", \"2\", \"4\", \"8\", \"12\", \"16\", \"20\", \"24\", \"32\", \"40\", \"48\", \"56\", \"64\", \"72\", \"80\", \"104\", \"128\", \"160\", or xs–xl). \"6\" and \"10\" are not tokens and are type errors.","layout.noSpanOrType":"Row, Column and Grid have no span and no type prop. A clickable row is a Button (or a native <button>), and a Grid child spanning columns uses style={{ gridColumn: \"span 2\" }}.","Column.form":"Wrap a Column in a native <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>. Column as=\"form\" keeps the div event types, so a FormEvent<HTMLFormElement> handler (and noValidate) is a type error."},"quality":{"mount":"Mount the shell once, in the `layout.tsx` of the routes it frames, and read the route with `usePathname()`; a shell rendered by each page loses its open groups and collapsed state on every navigation","current":"`selectNavHref` picks the highlighted item and opens the group that holds it","collapse":"A collapsed sidebar keeps every item reachable: icons with a tooltip or aria-label, the group label as the icon's name","phone":"At s the sidebar hides and a header button opens the same nav in a left Drawer; following a link closes it","header":"Breadcrumbs from the route, and the account or workspace switcher as a DropdownWrapper or UserMenu with Option rows","palette":"A header Search button opens Kbar with `open` and `onOpenChange` (no children); ⌘K still toggles it"},"mixins":{"CommonProps":{"onBackground":"Colors","onSolid":"Colors","align":"CSSProperties[\"textAlign\"]"},"DisplayProps":{"as":"ElementType","inline":"boolean","hide":"boolean","pointerEvents":"\"none\" | \"all\" | \"auto\"","userSelect":"UserSelect","position":"CSSProperties[\"position\"]","overflow":"CSSProperties[\"overflow\"]","overflowX":"CSSProperties[\"overflowX\"]"